WEBVTT

01:37.990 --> 01:43.039
[Shadow Punisher]

01:43.110 --> 01:43.700
[Divine Constable Tally]

01:43.700 --> 01:45.820
[Episode 10]

01:47.070 --> 01:48.830
[Wood Horse] [Earth Snake] [Earth Hare]

01:47.509 --> 01:50.070
The Tianshu Pavilion contains
everything in the universe.

01:50.070 --> 01:52.150
The distribution of archives and files

01:51.860 --> 01:52.170
[Wind]

01:52.430 --> 01:55.090
is based on the secret codes
of heaven and earth.

01:55.350 --> 01:57.350
Section A records
the daily life of the royal family

01:57.350 --> 01:58.880
and the secrets of the clan.

01:59.509 --> 02:01.590
Section B focuses on criminal cases,
unsolved cases,

02:00.570 --> 02:03.470
[Royal Secrets]

02:01.870 --> 02:03.530
and vendettas in the jianghu.

02:04.070 --> 02:06.150
Section C covers astronomy, astrology,

02:06.150 --> 02:07.350
and geography.

02:07.920 --> 02:08.960
And so on.

02:09.280 --> 02:11.030
As for the fire disaster
of the Prince's Hunting Ground

02:11.030 --> 02:12.520
in the 20th year of Hongyun...

02:12.520 --> 02:13.820
"A" represents imperial power,

02:13.820 --> 02:15.910
and "Hare" belongs
to the Wood element of the East,

02:15.910 --> 02:19.970
which exactly corresponds to the direction
of the Mulan Hunting Ground.

02:20.280 --> 02:22.120
Even the direction of the shelves
is mocking that

02:22.120 --> 02:22.910
Zhou Yan died in

02:22.910 --> 02:26.110
the second lunar month,
when all things come back to life.

02:35.710 --> 02:36.400
This is

02:36.400 --> 02:39.260
the royal secret kept on
the Hare shelf in Section A.

02:59.079 --> 03:00.190
Royal Records.

03:00.520 --> 03:02.450
Spring of the 20th year of Hongyun.

03:10.630 --> 03:12.170
[Imperial Astronomical Bureau’s Record
of Celestial Anomalies]

03:18.140 --> 03:24.060
[9th day of the 2nd lunar month
in the 20th year of Hongyun]

03:18.520 --> 03:20.150
In the suburbs of
the capital's Tianhuang City,

03:20.150 --> 03:21.079
at Mulan Hunting Ground.

03:21.079 --> 03:23.520
On the 9th day of the 2nd lunar month
in the 20th year of Hongyun,

03:23.520 --> 03:24.430
in the third solar term,

03:24.430 --> 03:28.130
Fourth Prince Zhou Yan
died in a mountain fire

03:29.310 --> 03:30.680
during a spring hunt.

03:30.530 --> 03:31.260
[9th day of the 2nd lunar month
in the 20th year of Hongyun]

04:03.680 --> 04:05.280
I want to go home!

04:05.470 --> 04:08.180
Brother, where are you?

04:08.470 --> 04:13.030
I want to go home! I want to go home!

04:14.030 --> 04:16.390
I want to go home!

04:17.870 --> 04:20.750
I want to go home!

04:21.310 --> 04:22.360
Who are you?

04:22.360 --> 04:24.560
I want to go home!

04:24.600 --> 04:25.390
How dare you!

04:25.430 --> 04:27.240
Your robe is embroidered
with dragon patterns.

04:27.240 --> 04:28.070
Don't you know

04:28.070 --> 04:29.430
this is a crime of overstepping?

04:29.430 --> 04:31.560
I didn't want to wear this.

04:31.560 --> 04:34.159
Someone put it on me.

04:41.680 --> 04:42.680
Stop crying.

04:44.310 --> 04:45.870
Are you lost?

04:47.830 --> 04:50.040
I am the Fourth Prince
of the current dynasty, Zhou Yan.

04:50.040 --> 04:52.380
I can ask my father to send you home.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.080
Really?

04:56.920 --> 04:59.060
My father wove this for me.

04:59.120 --> 05:00.250
You can play with it.

05:01.430 --> 05:02.240
Take it.

05:14.310 --> 05:15.240
Stop crying.

06:56.510 --> 06:57.480
Who are you?

07:01.720 --> 07:03.280
Who are you?

07:13.560 --> 07:14.940
As his father, I was overcome with grief.

07:14.940 --> 07:18.060
I suspended court for 3 days
to keep vigil for my beloved son.

07:18.060 --> 07:21.190
Following public opinion,
I bestowed upon my fourth son

07:21.630 --> 07:23.830
the posthumous title of Prince Qihuai.

07:26.330 --> 07:27.770
In the end, a prince

07:28.710 --> 07:30.710
was not as important as your empire.

07:34.510 --> 07:35.750
In your heart,

07:37.070 --> 07:37.870
have you ever

07:37.870 --> 07:39.560
truly felt heartache for me?

07:51.270 --> 07:52.360
The Fourth Prince

07:54.120 --> 07:57.000
died in a mountain fire
during the spring hunt.

08:01.720 --> 08:02.950
If I can find

08:03.750 --> 08:04.510
the cases related to

08:04.510 --> 08:06.370
missing children from that year,

08:06.950 --> 08:08.430
I might find a clue.

08:16.830 --> 08:18.570
[Criminal Investigation Cases]

08:33.289 --> 08:34.600
[Local Customs] [Pharmacology]
[Reconstruction of Lost Texts]

08:34.690 --> 08:35.750
[Wind]

09:15.570 --> 09:16.880
[Case File on the Disappearance
of the Shen Family of Four]

09:18.780 --> 09:20.810
[Case File on the Disappearance
of the Shen Family of Four]

09:28.110 --> 09:29.510
[Detailed Record from
the Divine Constable Bureau]

09:32.960 --> 09:35.060
[Cellar: 200 jin of radishes stored
for winter, stacked in a square pile]

09:35.130 --> 09:36.130
[Investigation Report
on the Shen Residence]

09:41.510 --> 09:44.240
On the 8th day of the 2nd lunar month
in the 20th year of Hongyun,

09:44.240 --> 09:45.910
in Yeqiao Town,
on the outskirts of the capital,

09:45.910 --> 09:47.510
scholar Shen Baoquan

09:47.510 --> 09:49.310
and his family of 4 went missing.

09:49.960 --> 09:51.080
Apart from two

09:51.080 --> 09:52.750
spurts of blood at the scene,

09:52.910 --> 09:54.240
there were no clues.

09:54.810 --> 09:56.410
This case remains unsolved.

10:01.330 --> 10:02.720
Missing persons:

10:02.800 --> 10:04.800
Shen Baoquan, 31 years old.

10:04.850 --> 10:06.830
Shen Jing'an, 11 years old.

10:07.570 --> 10:10.090
Shen Lan, 8 years old...

10:12.080 --> 10:14.140
The 8th day of the second lunar month.

10:15.270 --> 10:18.070
The day before the events at
Mulan Hunting Ground.

10:22.750 --> 10:25.270
Shen Lan, 8 years old.

10:27.510 --> 10:29.570
The 8th day of the second lunar month.

10:30.080 --> 10:32.880
The day before the events at
Mulan Hunting Ground.

10:54.510 --> 10:54.870
[Divine Constable, Qingyang]

11:46.630 --> 11:48.080
That is the God of Lies,

11:48.360 --> 11:49.150
Qipi.

11:50.150 --> 11:51.720
It has no eyes or nose,

11:51.800 --> 11:53.730
[God of Lies, Qipi]

11:52.240 --> 11:54.240
only a mouth that distorts the truth

11:54.510 --> 11:56.240
and deceives people's hearts.

11:59.440 --> 12:00.510
Chief.

12:02.080 --> 12:03.270
Why are you here?

12:03.750 --> 12:05.200
It's almost midnight.

12:05.270 --> 12:06.670
You were in there for a long time,

12:06.670 --> 12:08.670
so I thought I'd come and take a look.

12:09.910 --> 12:11.670
As expected, nothing escapes

12:11.910 --> 12:13.390
the Chief's eyes.

12:15.840 --> 12:18.550
Tianshu Pavilion is really too big.

12:18.630 --> 12:21.030
I accidentally lost track of time.

12:23.720 --> 12:25.270
To linger like this,

12:26.080 --> 12:27.790
you must have found something

12:27.840 --> 12:29.510
interesting to you.

12:33.960 --> 12:35.420
I originally thought that

12:35.550 --> 12:36.590
Tianshu Pavilion

12:36.720 --> 12:38.630
was only used to store archives.

12:38.870 --> 12:39.870
I didn't expect

12:40.910 --> 12:41.720
there to be

12:41.720 --> 12:43.450
such a magnificent place here.

12:44.240 --> 12:45.910
I am but a layman.

12:46.080 --> 12:47.510
Despite studying them for a long while,

12:47.510 --> 12:49.040
I still couldn't figure out

12:49.270 --> 12:50.630
what was so profound

12:50.720 --> 12:52.360
about these god murals.

12:52.840 --> 12:54.840
If, as the Chief just said,

12:55.630 --> 12:57.550
Qipi represents lies,

12:58.320 --> 12:59.120
then

12:59.150 --> 13:00.790
what do the other gods

13:01.360 --> 13:02.720
represent?

13:03.550 --> 13:04.720
Chief,

13:05.150 --> 13:07.870
could you please enlighten me?

13:12.030 --> 13:13.080
This is Kelu,

13:13.670 --> 13:15.630
and this is Rangnan.

13:16.070 --> 13:19.750
They respectively oversee the Immortality
and Prophecy of all beings.

13:19.750 --> 13:20.550
Kelu?

13:21.870 --> 13:23.480
Is it the God Kelu that Wen Nansheng

13:23.480 --> 13:24.480
mentioned?

13:25.630 --> 13:26.440
Qipi

13:27.960 --> 13:29.200
represents lies.

13:31.080 --> 13:34.240
Haiqu is in charge of hatred.

13:34.100 --> 13:35.360
[God of Hatred, Haiqu]

13:36.030 --> 13:38.080
Qiuyu is the God of Calamity.

13:36.370 --> 13:38.330
[God of Calamity, Qiuyu]

13:38.870 --> 13:40.390
And this last one,

13:41.240 --> 13:42.080
Hanluo,

13:43.360 --> 13:45.910
represents death.

13:46.310 --> 13:49.050
[God of Death, Hanluo]

13:49.630 --> 13:51.270
Are these all murals

13:51.270 --> 13:52.730
of the ancient Liluo Sect?

13:53.630 --> 13:54.720
But why are they here

13:54.720 --> 13:56.920
in the secret room of Tianshu Pavilion?

13:58.150 --> 13:59.390
These murals

13:59.840 --> 14:01.600
look really strange.

14:02.360 --> 14:03.270
They really don't look like

14:03.270 --> 14:04.870
things from our Shi Dynasty.

14:05.240 --> 14:06.030
Chief,

14:06.480 --> 14:08.270
may I know why you kept them

14:08.670 --> 14:10.870
in the secret room of Tianshu Pavilion?

14:11.910 --> 14:12.910
These are indeed

14:13.440 --> 14:15.270
not products of our Shi Dynasty.

14:16.270 --> 14:17.720
The reason they are sealed in

14:17.720 --> 14:19.670
the deepest part of Tianshu Pavilion

14:19.670 --> 14:20.600
is that

14:22.320 --> 14:25.270
these things are highly ominous.

14:26.030 --> 14:26.910
Seeing them,

14:27.750 --> 14:28.960
you will understand

14:29.750 --> 14:30.960
where all the

14:30.960 --> 14:32.360
pain and sin in this world

14:33.240 --> 14:34.480
come from.

14:37.090 --> 14:38.280
Are these gods

14:38.960 --> 14:41.150
actually the source of all pain

14:42.080 --> 14:43.630
and sin in the world?

14:47.320 --> 14:48.380
You must remember.

14:49.720 --> 14:52.030
Even the closest people around you

14:52.910 --> 14:54.600
may not be what you see

14:55.080 --> 14:56.550
with your own eyes.

15:02.240 --> 15:04.570
I will keep the Chief's teachings in mind.

15:27.580 --> 15:30.910
[Yeqiao Town, Outskirts of Tianhuang City]

16:30.000 --> 16:30.790
Miss.

16:31.030 --> 16:32.470
It's hot. Have some herbal tea.

16:32.470 --> 16:33.150
Take a look.

16:34.510 --> 16:35.510
It cools you down.

16:35.670 --> 16:36.480
Aunt Wang.

16:36.930 --> 16:37.910
Did you just make this?

16:37.910 --> 16:39.840
Yes, it's freshly woven.

16:40.120 --> 16:41.080
Excuse me, sir.

16:41.550 --> 16:42.870
May I ask

16:43.270 --> 16:45.080
how to get to this address?

16:43.580 --> 16:45.320
[List of Missing Persons]

16:46.550 --> 16:47.630
The Shen family?

16:47.670 --> 16:49.130
It's the courtyard ahead.

16:50.910 --> 16:52.780
[Noodles]

16:51.750 --> 16:52.550
Thank you.

16:52.630 --> 16:53.440
Okay.

16:56.030 --> 16:56.890
Is anyone here?

17:01.320 --> 17:02.480
Is anyone home?

17:10.720 --> 17:11.550
Meng Rui?

17:12.960 --> 17:13.920
Why is it you?

17:14.310 --> 17:15.270
This is my house.

17:18.680 --> 17:19.740
This is your house?

17:25.960 --> 17:27.920
Of course I know this is your house.

17:28.270 --> 17:29.800
I came here looking for you.

17:30.030 --> 17:30.880
I thought

17:31.440 --> 17:33.240
the one opening the door would be

17:33.310 --> 17:34.510
a servant or maid.

17:34.640 --> 17:36.270
How did you find my house?

17:39.110 --> 17:40.590
Didn't the Chief ask Yan and the others

17:40.590 --> 17:41.790
to escort you back?

17:42.160 --> 17:43.070
I asked them.

17:44.270 --> 17:45.350
No one in the bureau knows

17:45.350 --> 17:46.270
my address.

17:52.440 --> 17:53.270
I admit,

17:53.680 --> 17:55.960
I followed you that day.

17:56.310 --> 17:57.830
With my lightness skill,

17:57.920 --> 17:59.270
following you here

17:59.720 --> 18:01.270
was a piece of cake.

18:07.270 --> 18:08.440
Didn't you say

18:09.090 --> 18:11.810
you've been homeless since you were 11

18:11.920 --> 18:13.380
and studied under Dao Yin?

18:13.920 --> 18:14.830
I didn't expect

18:15.270 --> 18:17.070
that you'd own such an old house

18:17.350 --> 18:18.830
here in Tianhuang City.

18:19.310 --> 18:20.030
Why haven't I

18:20.030 --> 18:21.640
heard you mention it before?

18:22.030 --> 18:22.880
Or is it

18:23.830 --> 18:26.000
that this house is...

18:26.000 --> 18:26.720
Meng Rui.

18:26.910 --> 18:28.520
Meng Rui! Meng Rui!

18:34.070 --> 18:36.550
My parents must be waiting for me!

18:36.550 --> 18:37.590
And my brother!

18:37.640 --> 18:39.270
He must be anxiously waiting for me

18:39.270 --> 18:40.640
to fly kites together!

18:45.290 --> 18:47.440
Shen Jing'an, 11 years old.

18:48.550 --> 18:50.940
Shen Lan, 8 years old.

19:44.550 --> 19:45.350
Yan'er.

19:51.510 --> 19:53.440
So beautiful! It's awesome!

19:53.880 --> 19:54.920
Awesome!

19:54.920 --> 19:58.070
-Father made me a grasshopper!
-Slow down, Fourth Prince.

19:58.070 --> 20:00.350
Father made me a grasshopper!

20:00.350 --> 20:02.440
The grasshopper Father made me

20:02.550 --> 20:05.070
is the most beautiful in the world!

20:06.550 --> 20:07.350
Father,

20:07.350 --> 20:09.480
will you make more for me in the future?

20:09.790 --> 20:10.790
I will weave a hundred grasshoppers

20:10.790 --> 20:12.440
for you, Yan'er.

20:12.750 --> 20:14.310
Why a hundred?

20:14.310 --> 20:17.590
Because I hope you

20:17.800 --> 20:19.460
can live a long life.

20:21.640 --> 20:22.830
But Father,

20:23.100 --> 20:24.310
what would you do

20:24.310 --> 20:25.680
if I die

20:25.680 --> 20:26.790
one day?

20:27.220 --> 20:28.150
Nonsense.

20:35.440 --> 20:36.480
My Yan'er

20:36.680 --> 20:38.480
will surely live a long life

20:39.240 --> 20:40.530
and become the most outstanding emperor

20:40.530 --> 20:42.050
of our Great Shi Dynasty.

21:14.820 --> 21:18.030
[Shen]

21:21.750 --> 21:23.270
If you are Shen Lan,

21:24.110 --> 21:25.030
then I guess

21:27.680 --> 21:30.160
your brother Shen Jing'an is still alive.

21:31.470 --> 21:32.750
Bearing a blood feud,

21:33.480 --> 21:34.790
he changed his name.

21:36.160 --> 21:38.240
Maybe he even became a constable.

21:50.350 --> 21:51.680
I'll make a bet with you.

21:54.010 --> 21:56.070
He must be waiting for you to come home

21:57.540 --> 21:59.150
to fly kites together.

22:26.440 --> 22:27.500
As the saying goes,

22:27.680 --> 22:30.030
it takes a hundred days
to recover from a bone injury.

22:30.030 --> 22:33.880
Not to mention your injury
is quite serious.

22:36.350 --> 22:38.270
Mr. Meng, in the future,

22:39.070 --> 22:41.000
we will be neighbors.

22:41.440 --> 22:42.440
You are welcome

22:43.270 --> 22:44.960
to visit me regularly.

22:45.640 --> 22:46.570
What did you say?

22:49.110 --> 22:50.070
This house...

22:50.830 --> 22:53.070
I bargained it down to 240 taels.

22:53.790 --> 22:55.680
They said that since I wanted
to move in overnight,

22:55.680 --> 22:57.280
I had to add another 10 taels.

22:57.790 --> 22:58.590
I don't know

22:58.590 --> 22:59.880
if spending these 250 taels of silver

22:59.880 --> 23:00.750
was considered

23:01.110 --> 23:02.110
expensive or not.

23:07.920 --> 23:09.050
I have a gift for you.

23:17.450 --> 23:19.580
Shen Lan, let's see

23:19.890 --> 23:21.050
who wins this bet.

23:21.080 --> 23:22.450
You, or me.

23:23.400 --> 23:24.760
I can only try.

23:34.710 --> 23:36.590
Brother, you're flying it so high.

23:36.590 --> 23:37.350
Brother,

23:37.350 --> 23:39.110
can you fly it a bit higher?

23:39.110 --> 23:39.920
Okay!

24:14.220 --> 24:15.250
It seems

24:16.480 --> 24:18.100
my guess was right.

24:18.500 --> 24:20.000
Shen Jing'an has never

24:20.000 --> 24:20.790
forgotten

24:21.400 --> 24:23.320
the promise with his brother.

24:26.790 --> 24:27.920
The deeper the love,

24:28.640 --> 24:30.110
the deeper the pain.

24:52.110 --> 24:52.920
Meng Rui,

24:54.640 --> 24:55.790
don't mind

24:55.960 --> 24:57.000
the kite.

24:57.640 --> 24:59.640
I just wanted to give my new neighbor

24:59.640 --> 25:00.790
a little gift.

25:05.350 --> 25:06.880
Let's get down to business.

25:07.400 --> 25:08.590
I promised

25:08.960 --> 25:11.350
to tell you the situation
in the bureau.

25:12.030 --> 25:13.200
The case of the demon

25:13.400 --> 25:15.000
has made no progress so far.

25:15.550 --> 25:17.210
Lou Tianming's wanted poster

25:17.550 --> 25:20.160
has also been sent
to all prefectures and counties.

25:20.160 --> 25:21.490
You don't need to worry.

25:28.110 --> 25:28.920
By the way,

25:29.830 --> 25:31.090
there is one more thing

25:31.720 --> 25:34.310
that is crucial to the overall situation.

25:34.350 --> 25:37.000
Although the Chief repeatedly told me

25:37.160 --> 25:38.480
not to tell you yet,

25:38.750 --> 25:40.790
I think

25:42.310 --> 25:43.960
I should still let you know.

25:46.790 --> 25:47.590
Come in.

25:50.830 --> 25:51.720
When will you change your habit

25:51.720 --> 25:53.750
of always bringing up the Chief

25:53.960 --> 25:55.160
at every turn?

26:01.000 --> 26:02.350
What's on your back?

26:05.470 --> 26:07.330
The Kui Wood Wolf constellation.

26:07.590 --> 26:08.400
Ever since Dao Yin

26:08.400 --> 26:09.720
taught me the Severe-Cold Sword technique,

26:09.720 --> 26:10.750
I've had this.

26:11.310 --> 26:13.570
It appears whenever I channel my energy.

26:17.830 --> 26:19.440
I didn't expect this technique

26:19.440 --> 26:20.790
to be so profound.

26:22.310 --> 26:24.170
The Severe-Cold Sword technique

26:24.240 --> 26:25.700
is indeed extraordinary.

26:30.030 --> 26:31.160
You and Dao Yin...

26:31.790 --> 26:32.960
A beggar

26:33.160 --> 26:34.200
and a wanderer

26:35.160 --> 26:36.400
actually developed

26:36.750 --> 26:38.510
such a master-disciple bond.

26:39.120 --> 26:40.800
What a deep destiny.

26:49.510 --> 26:50.310
Meng Rui,

26:52.000 --> 26:52.610
why did you

26:52.640 --> 26:54.400
want to learn the
Severe-Cold Sword technique?

26:54.400 --> 26:55.260
Could it be that

26:56.200 --> 26:58.060
you have some deep-seated hatred

26:58.350 --> 26:59.750
and need peerless martial arts

26:59.750 --> 27:01.160
to take revenge?

27:20.200 --> 27:21.350
Nice drawing.

27:23.350 --> 27:24.750
But what is this you drew?

27:25.750 --> 27:27.400
This is the tattoo I saw

27:27.590 --> 27:28.720
on the demon's nape.

27:29.720 --> 27:30.510
Since

27:31.350 --> 27:33.350
they tattooed it on their bodies,

27:33.750 --> 27:34.720
it means

27:35.720 --> 27:36.920
this thing is crucial

27:37.350 --> 27:39.400
to them.

27:43.270 --> 27:44.070
Meng Rui,

27:45.640 --> 27:47.170
have you ever thought about

27:47.550 --> 27:48.240
investigating

27:48.240 --> 27:49.720
the origin of this bug?

27:49.960 --> 27:50.960
I was just planning

27:50.960 --> 27:53.560
to go to Tianshu Pavilion
to check it out later.

27:56.000 --> 27:58.350
Why would Tianshu Pavilion
know anything about this?

27:58.350 --> 28:00.330
For weird things like this,

28:00.550 --> 28:02.590
you have to rely on unorthodox methods

28:02.590 --> 28:03.480
to ask around.

28:08.750 --> 28:09.880
Are you interested?

28:10.310 --> 28:11.680
I'll take you to a place

28:12.000 --> 28:13.400
to help you investigate.

28:22.000 --> 28:23.730
This is the Underworld Market?

28:24.680 --> 28:25.480
That's right.

28:26.240 --> 28:28.040
This is the largest black market

28:28.140 --> 28:29.680
in Great Shi.

28:30.830 --> 28:32.750
The Divine Constable Bureau
has tried to raid it many times,

28:32.750 --> 28:34.350
but could never find a way in.

28:36.590 --> 28:39.030
I remember when you first joined
the Divine Constable Bureau,

28:39.030 --> 28:41.960
you arrested many merchants
from the Underworld Market.

28:41.960 --> 28:44.360
What is your relationship with this place?

28:44.960 --> 28:46.220
Lord Constable Ghost,

28:46.790 --> 28:47.920
don't forget.

28:48.350 --> 28:49.880
Besides being a constable,

28:50.240 --> 28:51.720
I am also a merchant.

28:52.400 --> 28:53.550
As a merchant,

28:54.200 --> 28:55.030
it's natural to have some

28:55.030 --> 28:56.200
connections.

28:56.640 --> 28:58.900
It's not surprising that I have dealings

28:59.350 --> 29:00.950
with the Underworld Market.

29:01.000 --> 29:01.830
Let's go.

29:19.920 --> 29:21.050
Why are you running?

29:22.110 --> 29:23.000
Don't worry.

29:23.720 --> 29:24.880
The one who came here today

29:24.880 --> 29:26.350
is not Lord Constable Ghost,

29:26.350 --> 29:27.310
but my friend.

29:29.480 --> 29:30.750
We are here to ask you

29:30.880 --> 29:32.310
about something.

29:34.960 --> 29:36.000
I really don't know

29:36.000 --> 29:37.480
where your master is.

29:46.160 --> 29:47.920
Have you seen this?

29:52.330 --> 29:53.390
The usual rules.

29:57.510 --> 29:58.370
Is that enough?

29:58.640 --> 30:00.240
Tell us everything you know.

30:04.750 --> 30:05.640
Mr. Meng...

30:08.240 --> 30:11.290
Have you ever heard of
the Five Wonders of Liluo?

30:11.670 --> 30:13.130
The Five Wonders of Liluo?

30:14.630 --> 30:16.710
This insect is called Chiying,

30:16.830 --> 30:19.240
one of the Five Wonders of Liluo.

30:19.650 --> 30:21.200
In our line of work,

30:21.310 --> 30:24.110
we often have to search around for

30:24.310 --> 30:28.370
snakes, insects, and poisonous plants
to use as medicinal ingredients.

30:28.790 --> 30:29.590
Rumor has it

30:30.410 --> 30:31.280
that Chiying

30:31.310 --> 30:33.510
loves to gather around graves.

30:34.440 --> 30:36.000
Someone once saw it

30:36.680 --> 30:38.010
while gathering herbs.

30:38.160 --> 30:38.960
Where?

30:39.830 --> 30:40.920
Where?

30:41.830 --> 30:43.310
When people get old,

30:44.110 --> 30:45.710
they really become useless.

30:47.310 --> 30:48.240
Useless...

30:50.160 --> 30:50.960
Speak.

30:57.720 --> 30:58.880
I remember now.

31:00.240 --> 31:03.720
It was found in Mingling County, Qingzhou.

31:03.960 --> 31:04.920
There's one person here

31:04.920 --> 31:05.920
who isn't marked.

31:05.930 --> 31:07.940
[Ministry of War Roster] [Su Wei]

31:06.310 --> 31:08.170
Could this person still be alive?

31:08.270 --> 31:09.240
This person

31:09.240 --> 31:11.110
went to Mingling County in Qingzhou
many years ago

31:11.110 --> 31:12.970
and disappeared without a trace.

31:13.070 --> 31:14.110
This Chiying insect

31:14.110 --> 31:15.790
is no ordinary bug.

31:16.110 --> 31:18.560
Anyone who sees it is terrified.

31:18.880 --> 31:19.680
However,

31:20.110 --> 31:22.440
that's all in the past.

31:22.720 --> 31:23.880
Later on,

31:23.880 --> 31:25.440
it disappeared completely.

31:25.440 --> 31:27.110
Since it is one of
the Five Wonders of Liluo,

31:27.110 --> 31:28.370
what makes it a wonder?

31:29.640 --> 31:31.440
Its wonder lies in its poison.

31:32.030 --> 31:33.550
If a hundred of them bite the body

31:33.550 --> 31:34.830
and the poison enters the marrow,

31:34.830 --> 31:36.880
it can turn a person into a demon.

31:37.350 --> 31:38.610
The poisoned person's

31:38.640 --> 31:41.240
physical capabilities
will increase severalfold,

31:41.240 --> 31:42.900
with a body of the netherworld

31:43.110 --> 31:44.720
and the soul of a beast.

31:45.960 --> 31:47.070
In that case,

31:47.920 --> 31:49.720
Liluo's Dark Night is using this method

31:49.720 --> 31:51.750
to turn living people
into demonic suicide squads

31:51.750 --> 31:52.830
for its use.

31:53.480 --> 31:54.480
No wonder those demons

31:54.480 --> 31:56.000
were impossible to kill.

31:56.550 --> 31:58.590
Their bodies have mutated.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.510
Half human, half demon.

32:01.240 --> 32:02.920
What an evil practice.

32:05.960 --> 32:07.000
You mentioned

32:07.440 --> 32:08.900
the Five Wonders of Liluo.

32:09.240 --> 32:10.700
Besides the Chiying bugs,

32:11.160 --> 32:12.690
what are the other wonders?

32:13.240 --> 32:14.770
You asked the right person.

32:18.160 --> 32:19.290
Trying to snatch it?

32:21.440 --> 32:22.240
Speak.

32:23.240 --> 32:24.640
Chiying bugs light the fire,

32:24.640 --> 32:26.400
eroding bones to spawn demons.

32:27.240 --> 32:28.240
The Chiying bugs.

32:28.730 --> 32:30.030
Luo flowers condense into jade,

32:30.030 --> 32:31.830
turning white hair black again.

32:32.070 --> 32:34.400
Tianmoluo, the fruit of immortality.

32:35.310 --> 32:36.880
Puppets pulled by moss threads,

32:36.880 --> 32:38.680
having neither tears nor heart.

32:40.510 --> 32:41.510
Puppetry.

32:42.030 --> 32:43.680
The moon's reflection
turns into the flower in the mirror,

32:43.680 --> 32:45.510
replacing old bones with new faces.

32:45.510 --> 32:46.960
The Canglang tide boils,

32:46.960 --> 32:49.420
and the Eight Wastelands breathe together.

32:52.640 --> 32:53.880
What are these two?

32:53.900 --> 32:55.450
I don't know about that.

32:55.510 --> 32:56.860
That's all

32:56.930 --> 32:58.190
I know.

33:00.750 --> 33:02.610
Liluo actually has 5 ultimate secret arts.

33:02.610 --> 33:03.920
They're carefully planning

33:03.920 --> 33:06.380
to use these evil arts
to revive their reign.

33:06.550 --> 33:07.810
Great Shi is in danger.

33:07.880 --> 33:10.110
You are quite concerned about
the country and the people.

33:10.110 --> 33:11.680
I thought Lord Constable Ghost

33:11.680 --> 33:14.280
only cared about
catching and killing people.

33:14.510 --> 33:15.310
Don't worry.

33:15.550 --> 33:16.110
If we can

33:16.110 --> 33:17.840
get a hold of this information,

33:17.930 --> 33:20.450
the Chief and the one on the dragon throne

33:20.490 --> 33:21.820
must have found out too.

33:29.030 --> 33:30.030
It's just that...

33:30.550 --> 33:33.080
We are in the open,
and the enemy is in the dark.

33:33.750 --> 33:34.880
It's hard for us to find

33:34.880 --> 33:36.110
their traces.

33:36.510 --> 33:38.160
How would we know if we don't try?

33:38.160 --> 33:39.070
Well said.

33:39.750 --> 33:41.810
As expected of Lord Constable Ghost.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.510
Old Geezer said

33:43.510 --> 33:45.640
the last place the Chiying bugs appeared

33:45.640 --> 33:47.440
was Mingling County, Qingzhou.

33:47.650 --> 33:48.450
How about it?

33:48.750 --> 33:49.880
Are you interested

33:50.000 --> 33:51.200
in going together?

33:58.920 --> 34:01.380
You're not thinking
of going alone, are you?

34:02.000 --> 34:02.680
If I take you,

34:02.680 --> 34:03.920
I have to ask the Chief for orders

34:03.920 --> 34:05.270
and treat it as official business.

34:05.270 --> 34:06.750
I haven't recovered from my injuries yet.

34:06.750 --> 34:08.670
Do you think the Chief would agree?

34:08.670 --> 34:09.840
Let me tell you,

34:09.960 --> 34:11.510
if you don't take me,

34:11.750 --> 34:13.630
I'll report to the Chief

34:13.710 --> 34:15.300
that you are investigating privately

34:15.300 --> 34:16.480
and acting without authorization.

34:16.480 --> 34:17.540
When that happens,

34:17.710 --> 34:18.880
the Chief will never

34:18.880 --> 34:20.190
dispatch you there.

34:20.230 --> 34:21.320
Think it through.

34:24.469 --> 34:25.550
Su Wei...

34:30.510 --> 34:31.360
Li Qingyang!

34:32.949 --> 34:35.150
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

34:41.770 --> 34:43.260
[Ministry of War Roster] [Su Wei]

34:56.150 --> 34:58.480
Going to Mingling County to find someone?

34:59.480 --> 35:01.610
I thought you were going to catch bugs.

35:04.670 --> 35:05.760
In a sea of people,

35:05.960 --> 35:08.510
do you think it's easier to find a person

35:08.880 --> 35:10.320
or a bug?

35:10.320 --> 35:11.150
Save it.

35:12.150 --> 35:14.350
With your current physical condition,

35:14.360 --> 35:17.490
it's a question whether
you'll even survive the search.

35:20.550 --> 35:21.360
Tell me,

35:22.670 --> 35:23.630
even if

35:24.360 --> 35:25.510
I find this Su Wei

35:25.510 --> 35:26.360
from back then

35:26.710 --> 35:29.440
and force him to tell everything
about what happened,

35:29.440 --> 35:30.230
will Father

35:31.280 --> 35:32.880
release my eldest brother?

35:34.670 --> 35:35.530
My disciple...

35:36.510 --> 35:37.400
Actually, you already

35:37.400 --> 35:38.670
know the answer,

35:39.510 --> 35:40.360
don't you?

35:46.150 --> 35:47.750
You already know the answer.

35:53.110 --> 35:55.050
[Su Wei]

35:55.610 --> 35:57.280
[Divine Constable Bureau]

35:56.000 --> 35:57.510
In Mingling County, Qingzhou,

35:57.510 --> 36:00.320
a green-haired demon suddenly appeared
on Mount Fuyao.

36:00.320 --> 36:02.570
Its appearance is terrifying,
and its movements are mysterious.

36:02.570 --> 36:03.880
It digs up graves, unearths corpses,

36:03.880 --> 36:05.610
picks bones, and eats carrion.

36:06.920 --> 36:08.120
Green-haired demon.

36:09.110 --> 36:10.510
The magistrate of Mingling County

36:10.510 --> 36:12.070
is quite good at naming things.

36:12.070 --> 36:12.630
Previously,

36:12.630 --> 36:14.510
similar cases had been reported.

36:14.880 --> 36:16.030
They were mostly

36:16.030 --> 36:17.150
baseless rumors

36:17.280 --> 36:18.440
and nonsense from people

36:18.440 --> 36:19.640
scaring themselves.

36:19.970 --> 36:20.960
Let the local officials

36:20.960 --> 36:22.360
investigate it further.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.280
Chief,

36:26.510 --> 36:27.920
please look closely.

36:28.110 --> 36:29.960
This case is very uncanny

36:30.070 --> 36:31.470
and by no means ordinary.

36:31.590 --> 36:32.990
What's uncanny about it?

36:33.110 --> 36:34.710
A demon with green hair?

36:42.860 --> 36:44.190
Reporting to the Chief,

36:44.760 --> 36:46.760
I asked Constable Li

36:46.760 --> 36:47.960
to bring up this case.

36:48.480 --> 36:51.340
But investigating the case
is not the main purpose.

36:51.670 --> 36:52.670
Then what is it?

36:53.070 --> 36:53.880
It's...

36:55.840 --> 36:56.840
To recuperate.

36:58.760 --> 37:00.090
You may not know, Chief.

37:00.400 --> 37:01.920
Since I was injured,

37:02.470 --> 37:04.320
I've been deeply troubled and restless.

37:04.320 --> 37:05.250
Mingling County

37:05.400 --> 37:07.070
is my ancestral home.

37:07.280 --> 37:09.150
For some reason, I suddenly...

37:10.550 --> 37:12.790
felt a bit homesick.

37:14.150 --> 37:15.320
I didn't know that.

37:16.110 --> 37:18.570
In that case,
your health takes precedence.

37:18.670 --> 37:19.760
Take your time there.

37:19.760 --> 37:20.890
Relax and rest well.

37:21.480 --> 37:23.210
As for the green-haired demon,

37:23.760 --> 37:25.560
leave it to the local officials.

37:26.000 --> 37:27.000
Thank you, Chief.

37:28.320 --> 37:29.510
Then I'll go too.

37:31.320 --> 37:32.110
Li Qingyang.

37:32.880 --> 37:33.550
Yes.

37:33.550 --> 37:34.510
Recently, the Ministry of Justice

37:34.510 --> 37:36.550
is going to shut down
some underground banks.

37:36.550 --> 37:38.070
Assist them on the side.

37:38.360 --> 37:39.480
You don't need to take the lead,

37:39.480 --> 37:40.810
but you need to be there.

37:40.960 --> 37:42.000
As a newly appointed Divine Constable,

37:42.000 --> 37:42.800
this task

37:42.800 --> 37:44.280
is perfect for you.

37:44.400 --> 37:44.960
But...

37:44.960 --> 37:45.960
It's settled.

37:46.190 --> 37:47.110
You may all leave.

37:47.110 --> 37:48.150
Chief...

37:55.000 --> 37:56.000
Chief.

37:56.000 --> 37:57.360
Constable Ghost
hasn't fully recovered yet.

37:57.360 --> 37:58.510
I am willing to accompany him

37:58.510 --> 38:00.170
to facilitate his treatment.

38:01.710 --> 38:02.510
Alright.

38:06.710 --> 38:07.510
Who else?

38:07.800 --> 38:09.400
Come in and say it all at once.

38:13.510 --> 38:14.510
Chief.

38:14.760 --> 38:15.550
What is it?

38:15.880 --> 38:17.280
Have you forgotten, Chief?

38:17.280 --> 38:18.960
While Mr. Meng has been recovering,

38:18.960 --> 38:19.920
all the fieldwork cases

38:19.920 --> 38:21.320
have fallen on me alone.

38:21.320 --> 38:22.440
Didn't you promise

38:22.590 --> 38:23.880
that after this matter,

38:23.880 --> 38:25.610
you would give me some time off?

38:27.510 --> 38:28.880
That is true.

38:28.880 --> 38:30.210
I forgot when I got busy.

38:30.360 --> 38:32.510
Then I grant you half a month's leave.

38:33.190 --> 38:34.480
Thank you, Chief.

38:47.760 --> 38:49.360
So I'm the only one left.

40:00.760 --> 40:03.890
Congratulations on your
successful mutation, My Lord.

40:06.360 --> 40:07.760
What about the others?

40:07.970 --> 40:09.360
My Lord, your talent is extraordinary.

40:09.360 --> 40:10.800
How can mere people compare?

40:10.800 --> 40:12.920
The current success rate
is less than ten percent.

40:12.920 --> 40:14.880
And even those who have mutated

40:14.880 --> 40:16.280
may experience

40:16.360 --> 40:17.480
sudden death.

40:20.760 --> 40:22.480
Go capture more people...

40:25.580 --> 40:27.230
Go capture more people.

40:27.710 --> 40:28.850
I want people.

40:29.320 --> 40:30.360
I want demons!

40:30.880 --> 40:32.960
Only a sufficiently powerful army

40:33.360 --> 40:35.360
can be invincible!

40:36.550 --> 40:37.360
Yes.
